# Optional. Points the app at a deployed game server for two-player games and
# the server-rendered voice. Leave unset and everything else still works —
# playing the engine, analysis, openings and puzzles are all browser-only.
#
# Local development needs no value: the app defaults to ws://localhost:8000
# when opened on localhost.
#
# Example for a deployed server (note wss:// for an https:// site):
# VITE_APP_WS_URL=wss://chess-trainer-server.onrender.com
